    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Disability-led self-advocacy and design organization founded by Liz Jackson (2017), US-based (NYC). Curates a list of disabled creatives available to consult and collaborate with brands; runs the WITH Fellowship placing disabled designers into studios, and CriticalAxis (community project analyzing disability representation in media/advertising). Type: Studio (small mission-driven collective doing hands-on consulting/advocacy, not a full-service agency). Country corrected US (prior migration value UK was wrong; Liz Jackson and the org are NYC-based). Capabilities tagged Brand strategy (locked); their work is also research/insight-heavy.",
